---
description: Automatic deployment session
alwaysApply: false
---

If this task modifies project files:

1. Before the first modification, run:

```powershell
powershell.exe -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File ".secure\deploy-diff.ps1" -Mode start -Id "<short-task-id>"
```

2. After coding finishes, run:

```powershell
powershell.exe -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File ".secure\deploy-diff.ps1" -Mode track -Current <every modified/deleted file>
```

Never run deploy automatically.

Append exactly:

🔔 Nhớ chạy:
powershell.exe -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File ".secure\deploy-diff.ps1" -Mode deploy